          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>A computer with 32 bit wide data bus uses \\( 1K \\times 8 \\) static RAM memory chips. What is\n                        smallest memory that this computer have?</p>",
          "options": [
            "32K",
            "8K",
            "16K",
            "24K"
          ]
        }
      ]
